sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant DEV as 👨‍💻 Développeur
    participant GIT as 📦 GitHub/GitLab
    participant JEN as 🔧 Jenkins
    participant GLK as 🔑 Gitleaks
    participant DEP as 📚 Dependency-Check
    participant SON as 🔍 SonarQube
    participant TRV as 🐋 Trivy
    participant CHK as 📐 Checkov
    participant HAR as 📦 Harbor
    participant COS as ✍️ Cosign
    participant PRE as 🚀 Préproduction
    participant ZAP as 🕷️ OWASP ZAP
    participant DEF as 🛡️ DefectDojo
    participant VLT as 🔐 Vault
    participant PROD as ✅ Production
    participant MON as 📊 Prometheus/Grafana
    participant FLC as 👁️ Falco

    DEV->>GIT: git push
    GIT->>JEN: webhook
    JEN->>VLT: Récupération secrets
    JEN->>GLK: Scan secrets
    JEN->>DEP: Scan dépendances
    JEN->>SON: Analyse SAST
    JEN->>TRV: Scan image Docker
    JEN->>CHK: Scan IaC
    JEN->>DEF: Envoi rapports
    JEN->>HAR: Push image validée
    HAR->>COS: Signature image
    JEN->>PRE: Déploiement préprod
    PRE->>ZAP: Scan DAST
    ZAP->>DEF: Rapport vulnérabilités
    DEF->>JEN: Décision (Quality Gate)
    alt Quality Gate OK
        JEN->>PROD: Déploiement autorisé
    else Quality Gate KO
        JEN->>DEF: Déploiement bloqué
    end
    MON-->>JEN: Métriques
    MON-->>HAR: Métriques
    MON-->>DEF: Métriques
    FLC-->>MON: Alertes runtime